  {
   "start": 6.253,
   "end": 6.515,
   "title": "What Kind of House Do You Want?",
   "level": "N3",
   "topics": [
    "daily",
    "comedy"
   ],
   "grammar": [
    "〜たい — want to do",
    "〜ないでほしい — want someone not to do"
   ],
   "quality": 5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "start": 6.253,
     "end": 6.275,
     "ja": "じゃ、早速お家の話なんですけど、",
     "en": "Well then, getting straight to talking about the house,",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.275,
     "end": 6.28,
     "ja": "はい。",
     "en": "Yes.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.28,
     "end": 6.305,
     "ja": "どんな家にしたいみたいなイメージってあったりしますか？",
     "en": "do you have any idea of what kind of house you want?",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.305,
     "end": 6.324,
     "ja": "いや、これがね、まだほとんどなくて、",
     "en": "Well, I barely have any idea yet,",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.324,
     "end": 6.329,
     "ja": "あ、そうですか。",
     "en": "Oh, is that so?",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.329,
     "end": 6.346,
     "ja": "頭の中でまだざっくりなんですよね。",
     "en": "It's still just very rough in my head.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.346,
     "end": 6.369,
     "ja": "あー、じゃあ特に無ければ、このアパートの感じになって…",
     "en": "Ah, so if there's nothing specific, it'll end up like this apartment...",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.369,
     "end": 6.382,
     "ja": "いや、こういう風にはしないでほしいです。",
     "en": "No, I don't want you to make it like this.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.382,
     "end": 6.403,
     "ja": "別に、物凄い今気に入ってるわけじゃないんでね。",
     "en": "It's not like I particularly love this place.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.403,
     "end": 6.408,
     "ja": "あ、そうですか。",
     "en": "Oh, really?",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.408,
     "end": 6.425,
     "ja": "これでいいんだったら、家作りませんから。",
     "en": "If this was fine, I wouldn't be building a house.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.425,
     "end": 6.43,
     "ja": "あ、そうですか。",
     "en": "I see.",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.43,
     "end": 6.442,
     "ja": "はい。もっと広くしたいです。",
     "en": "Yeah. I want to make it much bigger.",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.442,
     "end": 6.466,
     "ja": "こう、和風がいいとか、洋風がいいとか、",
     "en": "Like, Japanese style, Western style,",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.466,
     "end": 6.474,
     "ja": "シーザーがいいとか。",
     "en": "or Caesar style.",
     "speaker": "Architect"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.474,
     "end": 6.51,
     "ja": "いや、ドレッシング選んでんじゃないんですから。",
     "en": "Hey, we're not picking salad dressing here!",
     "speaker": "Customer"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 7.102,
   "end": 7.365,
   "title": "An Underground House?",
   "level": "N3",
   "topics": [
